@startuml Auth_Flow
title User Authentication (UC1) — Analysis View

actor Traveler
participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "Backend" as Backend
participant "Authentication\\nProvider" as AuthProvider

== Sign Up ==

Traveler -> App: Enter email, password, and name
activate App

App -> Backend: POST /auth/signup
activate Backend

Backend -> AuthProvider: Create user account
activate AuthProvider
AuthProvider --> Backend: User created
deactivate AuthProvider

Backend -> Backend: Store user profile
Backend --> App: Account created and logged in
deactivate Backend

App --> Traveler: Signed in successfully
deactivate App

== Login ==

Traveler -> App: Enter email and password
activate App

App -> Backend: POST /auth/login
activate Backend

Backend -> AuthProvider: Verify credentials
activate AuthProvider
AuthProvider --> Backend: Credentials verified
deactivate AuthProvider

Backend --> App: Authentication token
deactivate Backend

App --> Traveler: Logged in
deactivate App

@enduml
